    <!-- Services Detail -->
    <section class="services-detail">
        <div class="container">
            <p>Electrical services for your home.</p>

            <div class="service-item">
                <h2>Panel Upgrades</h2>
                <p>Older homes often need panel upgrades to support modern electrical demands including EV charging, air conditioning, and home offices.</p>

                <p><strong>We upgrade panels when:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>You're adding major loads (EV charger, hot tub, addition)</li>
                    <li>You have Federal Pacific or Zinsco (fire hazards)</li>
                    <li>Breakers trip constantly</li>
                    <li>Insurance company demands it</li>
                    <li>Still running on fuses</li>
                </ul>

                <p><strong>Typical upgrade includes:</strong> New 200-amp panel, updated grounding and bonding to current code, service disconnects, surge protection, and inspection.</p>
                <a href="electrical-panel-upgrade.html" class="btn btn-primary">Learn About Panel Upgrades</a>
            </div>

            <div class="service-item">
                <h2>EV Charger Installation</h2>
                <p>Professional installation of home EV chargers for all electric vehicles. Includes load calculations, permit handling, and panel upgrades when necessary.</p>

                <p><strong>EV charging services:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Load calculations to see if your panel can handle it</li>
                    <li>Tesla Wall Connector installation</li>
                    <li>Universal Level 2 chargers (works with any EV)</li>
                    <li>NEMA 14-50 outlets for portable chargers</li>
                    <li>Panel upgrades if needed</li>
                    <li>Permit handling</li>
                </ul>

                <a href="ev-charger-installation.html" class="btn btn-primary">EV Charger Information</a>
            </div>

            <div class="service-item">
                <h2>Backup Power Solutions</h2>
                <p>Michigan weather causes regular power outages. Ice storms, wind storms, vehicle accidents. We offer two backup power options to fit different budgets and needs.</p>

                <p><strong>Portable generator with interlock kit:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Professional interlock installation</li>
                    <li>Works with your existing generator</li>
                    <li>Or we supply tri-fuel generators</li>
                    <li>50-amp models power all lights and outlets</li>
                    <li>Same-day installation</li>
                </ul>

                <p><strong>Automatic standby generators:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>22kW Generac systems (most common)</li>
                    <li>Automatic operation - no intervention needed</li>
                    <li>Natural gas or propane connection</li>
                    <li>Powers entire home</li>
                    <li>2-day installation once permitted</li>
                </ul>

                <div>
                    <a href="generators.html" class="btn btn-primary">View Generator Options</a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="service-item">
                <h2>Residential Electrical</h2>
                <p>Complete residential electrical services including troubleshooting, repairs, and new installations.</p>

                <p><strong>Common residential work:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Troubleshooting:</strong> Flickering lights, dead outlets, mystery trips</li>
                    <li><strong>Outlet and switch work:</strong> Adding, moving, upgrading to USB</li>
                    <li><strong>Lighting:</strong> Recessed lights, under-cabinet, ceiling fans</li>
                    <li><strong>Code corrections:</strong> GFCI protection, grounding issues</li>
                    <li><strong>Old house rewiring:</strong> Knob and tube, aluminum wire remediation</li>
                    <li><strong>Kitchen and bath updates:</strong> Adding circuits for modern appliances</li>
                </ul>

                <a href="residential-electrical.html" class="btn btn-primary">Residential Services</a>
            </div>

            <div class="service-item">
                <h2>Spas, Hot Tubs & Saunas</h2>
                <p>We do electrical work for spas, hot tubs, and saunas. Tell us what you’re installing and we’ll work out what it needs.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-item">
                <h2>Network Wiring & Home Automation</h2>
                <p>Modern homes need robust network infrastructure and smart home integration. We provide complete low-voltage wiring and automation solutions.</p>

                <p><strong>Network and automation services:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Structured network cabling (Cat5e/Cat6)</li>
                    <li>WiFi access point installation</li>
                    <li>Smart home device integration</li>
                    <li>Home automation systems</li>
                    <li>Security camera wiring</li>
                    <li>Home theater pre-wiring</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="service-item">
                <h2>Small Commercial Projects</h2>
                <p>Most of our work is residential. We also do electrical work for small stores and schools. Contact us to talk through the job.</p>
            </div>

        </div>
    </section>

